01:38:09.478 --> 01:38:11.049
What?

1303
01:38:11.084 --> 01:38:12.391
We had enough
Astrophage to get here

1304
01:38:12.415 --> 01:38:13.920
but not enough to get back.

1305
01:38:13.955 --> 01:38:16.714
So,
what happens Grace, question?

1306
01:38:16.749 --> 01:38:18.815
Oh I got enough food to last me

1307
01:38:18.850 --> 01:38:20.322
at least a couple years.

1308
01:38:20.357 --> 01:38:22.819
Maybe a couple more
if I stretch it out.

1309
01:38:23.421 --> 01:38:25.998
So Grace die, question?

1310
01:38:26.033 --> 01:38:28.132
Yeah, once we're done, I'm

1311
01:38:29.399 --> 01:38:30.563
I'm gonna die.

1312
01:38:32.798 --> 01:38:34.435
Why didn't you tell me?

1313
01:38:35.207 --> 01:38:37.042
It slipped my mind.

1314
01:38:37.077 --> 01:38:39.638
No.
Grace say Grace go home.

1315
01:38:39.673 --> 01:38:41.211
Look.

1316
01:38:41.246 --> 01:38:44.148
- Listen. Listen. Listen.
- No. No.

1317
01:38:45.052 --> 01:38:46.909
I got to meet you.

1318
01:38:46.944 --> 01:38:49.351
I got to do
all this amazing stuff.

1319
01:38:49.386 --> 01:38:51.782
I'm good.
I've made peace with it.

1320
01:38:52.518 --> 01:38:54.719
What mean?
What mean "make peace"?

1321
01:38:54.754 --> 01:38:56.292
It means

1322
01:38:56.998 --> 01:38:59.427
I know I'm not going home

1323
01:38:59.462 --> 01:39:00.923
I know why

1324
01:39:00.958 --> 01:39:02.892
and it's okay.

1325
01:39:06.073 --> 01:39:08.007
- Thumbs up?
- No.

1326
01:39:08.042 --> 01:39:09.734
- Tiny thumbs up?
- No.

1327
01:39:10.671 --> 01:39:13.276
We got stars to save. Okay?

1328
01:39:18.085 --> 01:39:20.217
- Grace?
- Yeah.

1329
01:39:20.945 --> 01:39:22.516
You are

1330
01:39:25.818 --> 01:39:27.158
Need word.

1331
01:39:27.193 --> 01:39:29.061
W-W-What word do you need?

1332
01:39:29.096 --> 01:39:31.294
To risk self to help another.

1333
01:39:31.329 --> 01:39:32.493
Uh, dumb.

1334
01:39:33.298 --> 01:39:34.792
Grace?

1335
01:40:00.358 --> 01:40:02.523
How much Astrophage
you need, question?

1336
01:40:03.493 --> 01:40:05.592
Two million kilograms.

1337
01:40:10.137 --> 01:40:11.796
I can give.

1338
01:40:15.076 --> 01:40:18.044
I go home six years slower.

1339
01:40:20.114 --> 01:40:21.674
That's too much.

1340
01:40:22.710 --> 01:40:24.380
Rocky watch crew die.

1341
01:40:24.976 --> 01:40:26.481
Could not fix.

1342
01:40:27.451 --> 01:40:29.286
Grace say Grace will die.

1343
01:40:30.091 --> 01:40:31.585
Rocky fix.

1344
01:40:47.669 --> 01:40:49.438
Grace go home.

1345
01:41:00.616 --> 01:41:01.912
Okay.

1346
01:41:24.343 --> 01:41:27.377
I thought
you made peace, question?

1347
01:41:27.412 --> 01:41:30.413
I didn't mean any of that.

1348
01:41:31.383 --> 01:41:33.284
That's just something you say.

1349
01:41:40.524 --> 01:41:41.853
Thank you.

1350
01:41:50.369 --> 01:41:51.533
Get over here.

1351
01:41:54.032 --> 01:41:56.967
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
What? What's happening?

1352
01:41:57.002 --> 01:41:59.376
- A hug.
- Oh! Hmm.

1353
01:41:59.411 --> 01:42:03.347
It's usually not something
one does by themselves.

1354
01:42:03.382 --> 01:42:05.008
Oh. Wait, I do the same?

1355
01:42:05.043 --> 01:42:06.713
Would you just get in here?

1356
01:42:14.921 --> 01:42:17.328
How do you know
when the hug is done?

1357
01:42:17.363 --> 01:42:19.429
- You just feel it.
- Oh.

1358
01:42:20.828 --> 01:42:22.366
Are you feeling it now?

1359
01:42:22.401 --> 01:42:23.466
Nope.

1360
01:42:23.501 --> 01:42:24.962
Oh. Oh, okay. Yeah.

1361
01:42:30.277 --> 01:42:32.541
<i>We ran the sampler
simulation again this morning.</i>

1362
01:42:32.576 --> 01:42:34.807
Shapiro and DuBois
nailed it again.

1363
01:42:34.842 --> 01:42:36.710
Okay. What about the others?

1364
01:42:37.416 --> 01:42:38.745
They'll be ready.

1365
01:42:38.780 --> 01:42:40.109
I expect so.

1366
01:42:40.782 --> 01:42:42.287
They have a great teacher.

1367
01:42:45.820 --> 01:42:47.149
Can you
take a compliment please?

1368
01:42:47.184 --> 01:42:48.557
No.

1369
01:42:48.592 --> 01:42:50.262
It's an order. Okay?

1370
01:42:50.297 --> 01:42:53.661
Okay. If it's an order,
I'll take it. Thank you.

1371
01:42:54.334 --> 01:42:56.125
Good.

1372
01:42:58.404 --> 01:42:59.766
What do you think?

1373
01:42:59.801 --> 01:43:02.670
It's pretty impressive.

1374
01:43:03.541 --> 01:43:04.936
- Yeah.
- You're

1375
01:43:06.379 --> 01:43:07.543
You're good.

1376
01:43:11.318 --> 01:43:13.417
Three days, huh?

1377
01:43:15.080 --> 01:43:16.255
Yeah.

1378
01:43:17.753 --> 01:43:21.051
So, what are you gonna do
for the next 20 years?

1379
01:43:21.086 --> 01:43:22.151
You got a plan?

1380
01:44:14.744 --> 01:44:17.008
<i>Manual mode activated.</i>

1381
01:44:22.950 --> 01:44:24.015
Go.

1382
01:44:55.147 --> 01:44:56.388
That's not half bad!

1383
01:44:56.423 --> 01:44:57.818
Is full good.

1384
01:45:04.365 --> 01:45:05.793
Time go fishing, question?

1385
01:45:05.828 --> 01:45:07.465
It's now or never.

1386
01:45:19.677 --> 01:45:21.050
- Three thousand meters.
- Three thousand.

1387
01:45:21.074 --> 01:45:22.381
Probe signal good.

1388
01:45:39.829 --> 01:45:41.499
Now comes the fun part.

1389
01:45:41.534 --> 01:45:42.775
Grace go out on hull
to retrieve collector?

1390
01:45:42.799 --> 01:45:43.831
No fun at all.

1391
01:45:43.866 --> 01:45:45.129
It's a joke.

1392
01:45:45.164 --> 01:45:47.505
Oh, humor. Confusing.

1393
01:45:54.239 --> 01:45:55.876
You gotta be kidding me.

1394
01:45:55.911 --> 01:45:57.075
What problem, question?

1395
01:45:57.110 --> 01:45:59.176
It's fine. It's just

1396
01:45:59.211 --> 01:46:01.948
the sky is slightly on fire.

1397
01:46:05.085 --> 01:46:06.249
Words of encouragement.

1398
01:46:07.118 --> 01:46:09.153
You can't just say
"words of encouragement."

1399
01:46:10.189 --> 01:46:12.156
<i>Words of great encouragement.</i>

1400
01:46:12.191 --> 01:46:13.465
<i>Nope.</i>

1401
01:46:35.280 --> 01:46:37.148
- <i>Did you feel that?</i>
- Yes.

1402
01:46:37.986 --> 01:46:40.492
I'm not worried.
Are you worried?

1403
01:46:40.527 --> 01:46:41.658
Yes.

1404
01:46:41.693 --> 01:46:42.824
Great.

1405
01:46:56.939 --> 01:46:59.511
Collector is closed.
Move winch into position.

1406
01:47:03.308 --> 01:47:04.813
Whoa!

1407
01:47:11.448 --> 01:47:13.052
<i>How long
is this supposed to take?</i>

1408
01:47:14.792 --> 01:47:16.220
<i>Collector should be here soon.</i>

1409
01:47:16.255 --> 01:47:18.057
Yeah. It's here.

1410
01:47:18.092 --> 01:47:19.256
Amaze, amaze, amaze!

1411
01:47:24.538 --> 01:47:25.966
Careful. Collector important.

1412
01:47:26.001 --> 01:47:27.737
Yup.

1413
01:47:30.544 --> 01:47:32.643
<i>Altitude warning.</i>

1414
01:47:32.678 --> 01:47:33.710
Oh, hurry, hurry.

1415
01:47:49.992 --> 01:47:51.321
Hurry, hurry.

1416
01:48:02.070 --> 01:48:03.608
Grace?

1417
01:48:06.580 --> 01:48:07.711
Grace, status update.

1418
01:48:09.044 --> 01:48:10.582
Status update.

1419
01:48:11.211 --> 01:48:12.375
<i>Grace?</i>

1420
01:48:14.115 --> 01:48:15.521
<i>Grace is safe, question?</i>

1421
01:48:15.556 --> 01:48:17.754
I'm okay.

1422
01:48:17.789 --> 01:48:19.250
Good, good, good.

1423
01:48:19.285 --> 01:48:21.087
Come inside
with predator collector now.

1424
01:48:22.992 --> 01:48:24.794
Uh

1425
01:48:24.829 --> 01:48:26.961
<i>Why not moving, question?</i>

1426
01:48:28.635 --> 01:48:31.361
<i>Warning!
Exterior temperature elevated.</i>

1427
01:48:31.396 --> 01:48:33.297
Must move now. Go, go.

1428
01:48:42.110 --> 01:48:44.242
No, Grace.
Bad idea. Come inside.

1429
01:48:44.277 --> 01:48:46.079
I'll be there in a minute.

1430
01:48:46.114 --> 01:48:47.982
<i>No, no, no,
no, no. Grace will die.</i>

1431
01:48:48.751 --> 01:48:50.556
Can repeat mission.
Can try again later.

1432
01:48:50.591 --> 01:48:52.217
I don't think
there is gonna be a later.

1433
01:48:52.252 --> 01:48:54.450
Abort, abort, abort.

1434
01:48:54.485 --> 01:48:57.222
<i>Grace will die.
No-No-No-No-No-No-No-No-No.</i>

1435
01:49:28.024 --> 01:49:29.595
- Grace?
- I'm here!

1436
01:49:30.664 --> 01:49:32.059
Amaze, amaze, amaze!

1437
01:49:32.094 --> 01:49:33.830
Grace okay, question?

1438
01:49:33.865 --> 01:49:35.700
Well, I'm not dead, so yes.

1439
01:49:35.735 --> 01:49:37.196
Good, good, good, good.

1440
01:49:37.231 --> 01:49:39.363
Where is that noise coming from?

1441
01:49:39.398 --> 01:49:40.804
Noise is from all around.

1442
01:49:40.839 --> 01:49:43.532
It's loudest
at port side of bedroom.

1443
01:49:43.567 --> 01:49:47.041
The gravity's
tearing the ship apart.

1444
01:49:48.847 --> 01:49:50.242
We leave now, question?

1445
01:49:50.277 --> 01:49:52.783
We leave now, statement.

1446
01:50:03.796 --> 01:50:05.730
<i>Hull pressure warning.</i>

1447
01:50:05.765 --> 01:50:07.798
Hull bending
in big room below bedroom.

1448
01:50:07.833 --> 01:50:08.964
That's the fuel tanks.

1449
01:50:11.199 --> 01:50:13.430
- Oh. Bad, bad, bad.
- Well, it's not great.

1450
01:50:13.465 --> 01:50:14.772
- Bad, bad, bad.
<i>- Warning.</i>

1451
01:50:14.807 --> 01:50:17.071
Everybody, calm down.
Calm down!

1452
01:50:20.780 --> 01:50:22.219
Try and keep
yourself together, Mary.

1453
01:50:22.243 --> 01:50:23.715
- Stop engine now?
- Not yet.

1454
01:50:23.750 --> 01:50:25.750
We need to get
into orbit or we'll crash!

1455
01:50:25.785 --> 01:50:28.544
I have an idea.
First, no crash.

1456
01:50:28.579 --> 01:50:30.755
Then, not explode. Deal?

1457
01:50:30.790 --> 01:50:31.954
Deal!

1458
01:50:34.024 --> 01:50:35.925
Hold on.

1459
01:50:37.522 --> 01:50:38.994
Now?

1460
01:50:39.029 --> 01:50:40.193
Wait.

1461
01:50:43.396 --> 01:50:44.637
Now? Now?

1462
01:50:45.904 --> 01:50:47.640
Now!

1463
01:50:58.884 --> 01:51:00.081
Did we do it?

1464
01:51:21.775 --> 01:51:23.137
Why ship moving, question?

1465
01:51:23.172 --> 01:51:24.567
There's a hole in it!

1466
01:51:26.010 --> 01:51:27.713
<i>Hull breach.</i>

1467
01:51:27.748 --> 01:51:30.441
<i>Port side fuel compartments
11 and 12.</i>

1468
01:51:33.215 --> 01:51:35.644
Grace.
What happening, question?

1469
01:51:36.647 --> 01:51:39.285
The fuel is migrating to Adrian!

1470
01:51:44.490 --> 01:51:46.556
Eject bad fuel bay, question?

1471
01:51:46.591 --> 01:51:48.525
Yeah.

1472
01:51:48.560 --> 01:51:52.034
<i>Jettison port fuel tank
compartment 12. Confirm.</i>

1473
01:52:01.177 --> 01:52:03.375
Rocky!

1474
01:52:14.256 --> 01:52:18.555
<i>Jettison port fuel tank
compartment 11. Confirm.</i>

1475
01:52:18.590 --> 01:52:21.228
Eject other fuel bay.

1476
01:55:36.293 --> 01:55:37.787
One nanogram of Astrophage

1477
01:55:37.822 --> 01:55:40.163
just isn't enough
to blow up a building.

1478
01:55:40.198 --> 01:55:42.099
The quartermaster gave him

1479
01:55:42.134 --> 01:55:43.463
one milligram by mistake.

1480
01:55:43.498 --> 01:55:45.201
That's a million times
the heat energy

1481
01:55:45.236 --> 01:55:46.928
that they're prepared for.

1482
01:55:46.963 --> 01:55:49.975
A measuring mistake
killed my entire science team?

1483
01:55:50.010 --> 01:55:52.604
It doesn't matter.
We have to launch.

1484
01:55:59.316 --> 01:56:02.053
If we miss the orbital window,
it'll set us back months.

1485
01:56:02.088 --> 01:56:03.615
Yeah, but if no one's trained

1486
01:56:03.650 --> 01:56:05.320
to do the mission,
it won't matter.

1487
01:56:05.355 --> 01:56:06.915
Casualty projections
go up exponentially

1488
01:56:06.950 --> 01:56:07.993
if we delay.

1489
01:56:08.028 --> 01:56:09.291
We launch on schedule

1490
01:56:09.326 --> 01:56:10.435
with a replacement
science officer.

1491
01:56:10.459 --> 01:56:11.997
Okay, but

1492
01:56:13.792 --> 01:56:14.824
who?

1493
01:56:16.795 --> 01:56:19.136
I mean, that

1494
01:56:35.121 --> 01:56:36.351
I'm not an astronaut.

1495
01:56:36.386 --> 01:56:38.056
I don't need an astronaut.

1496
01:56:38.091 --> 01:56:40.619
I need an expert on Astrophage
who's mission-ready.

1497
01:56:40.654 --> 01:56:41.752
I'm not ready.

1498
01:56:42.621 --> 01:56:45.756
I don't have any training.

1499
01:56:45.791 --> 01:56:47.164
You'll pick it up.

1500
01:56:47.199 --> 01:56:48.561
I'm not an astronaut!

1501
01:56:49.230 --> 01:56:51.168
I put the "not" in astronaut.

1502
01:56:51.203 --> 01:56:52.862
I've never done anything...

1503
01:56:52.897 --> 01:56:54.996
I've never done a space wa...
I can't even moonwalk!

1504
01:56:55.031 --> 01:56:56.998
I haven't done
the whole pool thing.

1505
01:56:57.033 --> 01:56:59.000
No, no, no. This is just we do
for the picture,

1506
01:56:59.035 --> 01:57:00.210
for social media.

1507
01:57:00.245 --> 01:57:02.311
I'm not heroic in any way.

1508
01:57:02.346 --> 01:57:04.610
I get sick on an elevator.

1509
01:57:04.645 --> 01:57:07.052
Oh, perfect. There's
no elevator on the ship.

1510
01:57:07.087 --> 01:57:08.449
I cannot do this.

1511
01:57:08.484 --> 01:57:10.484
You're smart.
You'll figure it out.

1512
01:57:13.489 --> 01:57:16.391
This might be very hard
for you to understand,

1513
01:57:16.426 --> 01:57:18.063
but some people are failures.

1514
01:57:18.098 --> 01:57:19.889
Some people<i> don't</i> rise
to the challenge.

1515
01:57:19.924 --> 01:57:22.430
You've been present
for every major scientific

1516
01:57:22.465 --> 01:57:24.762
or strategic meeting
we've had on the mission.

1517
01:57:24.797 --> 01:57:27.028
You're missing out an
important part of the mission

1518
01:57:27.063 --> 01:57:28.964
which is the suicide part.

1519
01:57:28.999 --> 01:57:31.472
Grace, you'd be
in very cool company.

1520
01:57:31.507 --> 01:57:33.639
If you don't go, you die anyway.

1521
01:57:33.674 --> 01:57:36.840
Yeah,
but I die in 30 years with...

1522
01:57:36.875 --> 01:57:38.116
"With the rest of us."

1523
01:57:39.482 --> 01:57:42.450
You have no immediate family.
You don't even have a dog.

1524
01:57:45.290 --> 01:57:47.191
So, just so I'm clear

1525
01:57:48.084 --> 01:57:50.260
you're asking me right now

1526
01:57:52.693 --> 01:57:53.758
to give up my life.

1527
01:57:53.793 --> 01:57:55.628
I am. We all are.

1528
01:58:00.030 --> 01:58:01.370
Can I think about this?

1529
01:58:01.405 --> 01:58:02.536
You have three hours.

1530
01:58:48.078 --> 01:58:50.155
<i>Eye movement detected.</i>

1531
01:58:51.587 --> 01:58:53.356
<i>Good morning, Dr. Grace.</i>

1532
02:00:12.063 --> 02:00:14.063
I'll watch you sleep, pal.

1533
02:00:21.204 --> 02:00:22.544
But, uh

1534
02:00:24.284 --> 02:00:25.811
you gotta wake up.

1535
02:01:00.617 --> 02:01:02.287
<i>I'm not sure what to do.</i>

1536
02:01:07.151 --> 02:01:09.151
<i>Done everything I can think of.</i>

1537
02:01:14.994 --> 02:01:16.631
<i>I made him a heat lamp.</i>

1538
02:01:39.315 --> 02:01:41.755
<i>And he left me one last message.</i>

1539
02:03:23.793 --> 02:03:25.760
We have our predator.

1540
02:03:25.795 --> 02:03:28.631
Right now
I'm calling it "Taumoeba."

1541
02:03:28.666 --> 02:03:31.359
And I'm sure
that when you wake up,

1542
02:03:31.394 --> 02:03:35.099
you'll have a lot to say
about why that's a bad name

1543
02:03:35.134 --> 02:03:37.640
because it's just
an amoeba from Tau Ceti,

1544
02:03:37.675 --> 02:03:39.741
and we're putting "Tau"
in front of "amoeba."

1545
02:03:39.776 --> 02:03:42.678
But I would argue there's
an elegance to that.

1546
02:03:42.713 --> 02:03:43.844
A simplicity.

1547
02:03:43.879 --> 02:03:45.681
Let's not fight about it now.

1548
02:03:45.716 --> 02:03:48.409
We'll table it and we'll...

1549
02:03:48.444 --> 02:03:50.752
I did a test at different
atmospheric variables

1550
02:03:50.787 --> 02:03:53.953
and, fun fact, every time
I introduced nitrogen

1551
02:03:53.988 --> 02:03:55.658
it died.

1552
02:03:55.693 --> 02:03:57.220
And I know what you're thinking,

1553
02:03:57.255 --> 02:03:59.222
"Well, that's terrible
because that's a problem

1554
02:03:59.257 --> 02:04:02.324
'cause we need it to survive
in the conditions of Venus."

1555
02:04:02.359 --> 02:04:04.007
Obviously, I had to figure out
how to breed

1556
02:04:04.031 --> 02:04:06.570
a new strain of
nitrogen-resistant Taumoeba.

1557
02:04:07.969 --> 02:04:09.639
And guess what I used?

1558
02:04:09.674 --> 02:04:13.335
The breeder tanks that we made
with your xenonite.

1559
02:04:14.514 --> 02:04:16.041
And you know what?

1560
02:04:17.550 --> 02:04:19.781
Now we're just
